    <h1 data-split data-split-delay="120">Statistics</h1>
    <p class="lede">ARIES hasn&rsquo;t collected its own dataset yet &mdash; Phase 1 hasn&rsquo;t
    launched. The figures below are national reference statistics from the literature
    review this pilot is grounded in, not ARIES fieldwork, shown here as the backdrop
    this research responds to.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--paper">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">National context, not ARIES fieldwork</p>
    <div class="stat-grid u-mb-12" data-reveal-group="up">
      <div class="stat-card"><p class="stat-num">97.56%</p><p class="stat-label">Primary net enrollment rate, nationally</p></div>
      <div class="stat-card"><p class="stat-num">13.95%</p><p class="stat-label">Primary dropout rate, down from 26.2% in 2014</p></div>
      <div class="stat-card"><p class="stat-num">70%</p><p class="stat-label">Of 5th graders below basic proficiency, despite that enrollment</p></div>
      <div class="stat-card"><p class="stat-num">5%</p><p class="stat-label">Target share of GDP pledged for public education spending</p></div>
    </div>
    <p class="form-note u-mb-40">Source: National Student
    Assessment figures and the 12-Point Ministry Roadmap, as cited in the literature review on
    the <a href="research-publications.html">Publications</a> page.</p>

    <div class="chart-block" data-reveal="up">
      <h3>Primary dropout rate: falling, but slowly</h3>
      <div class="bar-row">
        <span class="bar-label">2014 (Khan et al. baseline)</span>
        <div class="bar-track"><div class="bar-fill is-muted" style="width:26.2%;"></div></div>
        <span class="bar-value">26.2%</span>
      </div>
      <div class="bar-row">
        <span class="bar-label">Current</span>
        <div class="bar-track"><div class="bar-fill" style="width:13.95%;"></div></div>
        <span class="bar-value">13.95%</span>
      </div>
      <p class="form-note u-mt-8">Attributed to expanded school-meal
      programs, targeted stipends, and gender-parity initiatives.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="chart-block" data-reveal="up">
      <h3>The graduate-to-job gap, each year</h3>
      <div class="bar-row">
        <span class="bar-label">New graduates, per year</span>
        <div class="bar-track"><div class="bar-fill is-muted" style="width:100%;"></div></div>
        <span class="bar-value">~700,000</span>
      </div>
      <div class="bar-row">
        <span class="bar-label">Formal jobs created, per year</span>
        <div class="bar-track"><div class="bar-fill" style="width:43%;"></div></div>
        <span class="bar-value">~300,000</span>
      </div>
      <p class="form-note u-mt-8">The gap falls hardest on tertiary-educated
      graduates, particularly women, and is a core reason this pilot studies job-oriented
      mindset alongside perceptions of education.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
